<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">EFESOFOƐ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efesofoɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">EFESOFOƐ</para>
  <para style="mt4">ƆFA MANE</para>
  <para style="mt1">EFESOFOƐ</para>
  <para style="ip">Né Efeso kuro ne la ɛpo noa, yeti né bɛle nekaa bɔ hyep (<char style="tl">ship</char>) bagyina ɔ (habɔ). Paul nzɛmbatrɛ akwanduo bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ nanu yeɛ ɔhɔle Efeso ɔ, na ɔne Akwila ne Prisila yeɛ bɛhɔle ɔ. Paul de wangyɛ berɛ, ɔyakyile Akwila ne Prisila berɛ kyɛ bɛyɛ asɛnka adwuma ne. Nakoso ye nzɛmbatrɛ akwanduo bɔ ɔtɔ so nza ne de, ɔtenane berɛ kɔyɛ afoɛ nza. Ɔyerele ye nwo hane nzɛmba ne, na ɔne aliemaa nemɔ fale adamvoa paa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesi ne, kɔyɛ afoɛ 60-61 Y.A<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> ne, yeɛ ɔhworɔle krataa he brɛle Efesofoɛ nemɔ ɔ, na sɔ mmerɛ ne, né baha ye bawura awuro<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyire kyɛ ne bama ye </char><char style="it">house arrest.</char></note> wɔ Roman. Edwirɛ bɔ ɔwɔ sɔ krataa he anu ne, ɔne bɔ ɔwɔ Kolosefoɛ nwomaa nanu ne soma paa. Na ɛhe maa yɛnwu kyɛ ebia Paul hworɔle sɔ ngrataa nyɔ namu wɔ mmerɛ komapɛ nu. Na ebia né ɔhaw bɔ asafo nyɔ ne yia ne te kõ.—-<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 5:19">Efe 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:16">Kol 3:16</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="ip">Tikiko yeɛ ɔfale Paul krataa he fili Roman brɛle Efeso asafo ne ɔ, ná ye ala yeɛ ɔfale Kolosefoɛ deɛ ne koso hɔle ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">Sɔ krataa he ka ngabɔnu nwo dwirɛ paa. Ahyɛaseɛ nala, Paul maa yɛnwuni Nyameɛ atirimbɔ, yeɛ ole kyɛ “ɔkɔha nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne bɔ ɔwɔ aseɛ so namukoraati kɔbɔ nu.” (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 1:10">Efe 1:10</ref></char>) Yeti odikyɛ Nyameɛ asomvoɛ bɔ bɛ bra maa ɔne Nyameɛ atirimbɔ ne yia. Osa hane dwumaa bɔ Kristo ne “mmenia [bɔ ɔfale bɛ] mane kyɛ akyɛdeɛ” ne koli wɔ sɔ atirimbɔ nanu ne.—<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 4:8">Efe 4:8</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="ip">Edwirɛ pee yeɛ Paul fa hyirehyirele kyɛbɔ Kristofoɛ te kõ nanu ɔ; ebie yeɛ ole kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Asafo ne te kyɛ nipadua, na Kristo yeɛ ole nipadua ne ti;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Asafo ne te kyɛ sua, na Kristo yeɛ ole nyɔboɛ titire bɔ ɔwɔ sua nanu ne;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Asafo ne te kyɛ brasua, na ohu yeɛ ole Kristo.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">Yeti sɛ yɛbrɛ yɛ nwo ase yɛma yɛ mmango a, ɔmaa asomdwie ba Kristofoɛ abusua nanu, ná yɛyɛ kõ. Afei koso, ɛhene kyire kyɛ yɛsuesua Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyameɛ nate Kristo so kɔfa asomdwie ne ngabɔnu kɔwa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 1:3-3:21">1:3–3:21</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Odikyɛ Kristofoɛ asafo ne yɛ kõ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 4:1-6:20">4:1–6:20</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ bɔ ɔpɛ yebo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 6:21-24">6:21-24</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Me Paul, bɔ Nyameɛ adaworoma nde Yesu Kristo somafoɛ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">mefa krataa he mekɔma akrongronfoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Efeso, bɔ bɛdi nahorɛ wɔ Kristo Yesu nu ne:<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Adom ne asomdwie bɔ ofi yɛ Baba Nyameɛ ne y'Awurade Yesu Kristo berɛ ha ɛmɔ.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Ayɛyie ha y'Awurade Yesu Kristo Baba, ofikyɛ wafa honhom nu nhyiraa mukoraati bie wahyira yɛ wɔ Kristo nu wɔ anwuro. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Ɛhene ati, ɔyele yɛ bokale Kristo so kora yeɛ bɛbɔ wiase, kyɛ yɛyɛ krongron bɔ dɛm ne ngekayɛɛ biala nne yɛ nwo wɔ ye nyunu, ofikyɛ ɔdɔ yɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Na ɔyɛle nhyehyɛɛ tole berɛ, kyɛ ɔnate Yesu Kristo so kɔfa yɛ kɔyɛ ye mmaa, ofikyɛ ɛhene yeɛ okuro na ɔsɔ ye nye ɔ, <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a mmenia kɔkamvo Nyameɛ adom kandinga bɔ ɔnate Ɔwa bɔ ɔdɔ ye naso afa alo yɛ ne. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Ɔnate ye mogya naso alɛ́ yɛ, kyire kyɛ yanya bɔne-fakyɛ, kyɛbɔ ye adom pembe ne te ne.<verse eid="EPH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />Sɔ adom ne yeɛ wamaa wabu yɛ so wɔ nyanza ne ndeaseɛ nu ne, <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />ofikyɛ wamaa yanwu ye apɛdeɛ nwo dwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea ne. Na ɔnate kyɛ ɔsɔ ye nye nati, ye bɔbɔ wabɔ ye ti anu kyɛ, <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />sɛ mmerɛ bɔ wahyɛ ne so a, ɔkɔha nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne bɔ ɔwɔ aseɛ so namukoraati kɔbɔ nu wɔ Kristo nu. <verse eid="EPH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Ye yeɛ yɛne ye ayɛ kõ, na wamaa yɛne ye mukoraati ayɛ nnehyeɛ, ofikyɛ bɔ ɔkora yɛ nikye biala bɔ okuro maa bɔ wabɔ ye ti anu ne ba nu ne, ye yeɛ wahyehyɛ wato berɛ ɔ, <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a yɛ bɔ yɛli moa yɛnyane anidasoɛ wɔ Kristo nu nati, mmenia kɔye Nyameɛ ayɛ, ná bahyɛ ye anuonyam. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Na ɛmɔ koso, mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔtele nahorɛ, bɔ ɔte ngoa bɔ ɛmɔ konya ye nanwo nzɛmba ne, ɛmɔ nyane anidasoɛ wɔ ye nu. Na ɛmɔ nyane ye nu gyidie, ɔnate ye so fale honhom krongron bɔ ɔfa hyɛle yɛ bɔ ne hyɛle ɛmɔ nzorɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Sɔ honhom ne di agyapadeɛ bɔ yekonya ye kyẽabie nanwo adanzeɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a okole bɛ bɔ bɛte Nyameɛ agyapadeɛ ne,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mmenia.”</char></note> ná wafa ayɛyie ne anuonyam wabrɛ ye.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Ɛhe ati, ofi mmerɛ bɔ ndele gyidie bɔ ɛmɔle ye wɔ Awurade Yesu nu, ɔne ɔdɔ bɔ ɛmɔle ye bɛma akrongronfoɛ nanwo dwirɛ ne, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />daa biala meda Nyameɛ ase mema ɛmɔ, na mebɔ mbaeɛ mema ɛmɔ, <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />kyɛ y'Awurade Yesu Kristo Nyameɛ, bɔ ɔte anuonyam Baba ne, ɔma ɛmɔ honhom bɔ ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ konwu nyanza, na ɔma ɛmɔte nningyein bɔ ɔye kyire nabo, ná wamaa ɛmɔ anya ye nwo nahorɛ nimdeɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Ná obukye ɛmɔ adwene nu maa ɛmɔnwu anidasoɛ bɔ yeti ɔfrɛle ɛmɔ, ɔne nningyein pa bɔ wafa wahyɛ akrongronfoɛ bɔ ne, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />ná wamaa ɛmɔ anwu kyɛbɔ ye tumi ne te piri na ɔbo so ma bɛ bɔ bɛte gyidifoɛ ne. Yɛnwu sɔ anwoserɛ ne, mmerɛ bɔ ye tumi ne yɛ adwuma ne; <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />ɛhene yeɛ ɔfa yɛle adwuma mmerɛ bɔ otingyele Kristo fili ewue nu, ná ɔfale ye tenane ye sa famaa so wɔ anwuro ne. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Nekaa bɔ wafa ye watena ne, ɔtra awaen, tumi, anwoserɛ, ne panyi biala. Na ɔtra dumaa biala, nná wiase he anu ngome, mmom wiase bɔ ɔba nanu koso. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Afei koso, wafa nikye biala wawura ye gya bo, na wamaa wayɛ panyi wɔ nikye biala so wɔ asafo nanu, <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />asafo ne yeɛ ole ye nipadua ne; na ye bɔ ɔmaa nikye biala di mu ne, ye yeɛ ɔmaa asafo ne di mu ɔ.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Ɔwɔ nu, né ɛmɔ awu ɛmɔ mvomsoɛ ne ɛmɔ bɔne nu, nakoso Nyameɛ amaa ɛmɔ awa ngoa nu, <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />ɛhene anu yeɛ mmerɛ bie ɛmɔbɔle ɛmɔ bra kyɛbɔ wiase ne kuro, kyɛbɔ mvrama bɔ ɔbɔ né panyi ne kuro ne, na sɔ mvrama ne yeɛ ole tumi bɔ ɔyɛ adwuma wɔ ngwalaa bɔ bɛ so yɛ se ne nu ne. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Mmerɛ bie, sɔ ala yeɛ ne yɛ mukoraati yɛbɔ yɛ bra ɔ, yɛlili y'akɔnnɔ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Anwoɔnaen akɔnnɔ.”</char></note> si, ná bɔ yɛ nwonaen ne y'adwene kyire yɛ ne, ɛhene yeɛ ne yɛyɛ ɔ. Na yɛ koso, né yɛte mmaa bɔ Nyameɛ afɛ bɛ so yaa, te kyɛ bɛ bɔ baha nala. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Nakoso, Nyameɛ bɔ y'awunvoin sone ne, ɔnate kyɛ ɔdɔ yɛ paa nati, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />wamaa yɛne Kristo mukoraati anya ngoa, ɔmva ye nwo kyɛ ne yawu wɔ yɛ mvomsoɛ nu ne. Ye adom ti, olɛle ɛmɔ ngoa. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Afei koso, watingye yɛne Kristo, na wafa yɛ waatena anwuro maa yɛne Kristo Yesu ayɛ kõ. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Na ɔnate kyɛ ye tianu nyɛ se nati, wɔ ewiase bɔ ɔba nanu ne, ɔkɔla ye adom bɔ ɔsone ne ali kohyire yɛ bɔ yɛne Kristo Yesu ayɛ kõ ne. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Ye adom ti, ɔnate ɛmɔ gyidie so alɛ́ ɛmɔ ngoa, ɛhe de, nná ɛmɔ yeɛ ɛmɔyɛle ɔ, ɔte Nyameɛ akyɛdeɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Oggyi ebie adwuma so, ná ebiala amva anhoɔhoa ye nwo. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Yɛte Nyameɛ sa noa adwuma, na ɔbɔle yɛ wɔ Kristo Yesu nu kyɛ yɛɛyɛ adwuma pa, adwuma bɔ Nyameɛ ali moa asiesie ato berɛ kyɛ yɛɛyɛ ne.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Yeti ɛmɔkaye kyɛ, mmerɛ bie bɔ wapɛ nu ne, aworɛ nu de, né ɛmɔte maen-maen nufoɛ. Ná ne bɛ bɔ bapɛ bɛ toa ne ka kyɛ ɛmɔte “ɛtó.”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyire kyɛ: “Ebie bɔ bɛpɛlle ye toa.”</char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né ɛmɔnze Kristo, né ɛmɔ ahwe ɛmɔ nwo koraa bafi Israel maen nanwo, ná bɔhyɛ nanwo apam ne koso, ne ɛmɔ bokka ye; né ɛmɔlle anidasoɛ biala wɔ wiase, na ne ɛmɔnze Nyameɛ koso. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Nakoso afei de, ɛmɔ bɔ ahaa né ɛmɔ wɔ dede ne, ɛmɔ ne Kristo Yesu ayɛ kõ, na ɛmɔnate ye mogya naso apingye Nyameɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Ye yeɛ wamaa yanya asomdwie, na waha kue nyɔ namukoraati wabɔ nu ne. Ná fasue bɔ ne wahyɛ yɛ nu ne, wadwiri wagua. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Wafa ye nipadua ne waye ɔtaen ne wafi berɛ, ɛhene yeɛ ole Mmeraa bɔ ne ahyɛdeɛ wɔ nu ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɔkɔmaa kue nyɔ namukoraati kɔbɔ nu kɔyɛ sona foforɛ, ná wamaa asomdwie awa; <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />na ɔnate asɛnnua naso asiesie kue nyɔ ne né Nyameɛ afia, ná kue nyɔ ne ayɛ nipadua kõ, ofikyɛ ye bɔbɔ wahu ɔtaen ne. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Ɔwale ne, ɔhane asomdwie nzɛmba ne hyirele ɛmɔ bɔ ne ɛmɔ wɔ dede, ɔne bɛ bɔ ne bɛpingye ne, <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />ofikyɛ ɔnate ye so yeɛ kue nyɔ namukoraati awa Baba ne berɛ nate honhom kõ aso.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Yeti kesaalae de, ɛmɔtte ɛwɔfoɛ ne amanfrafoɛ kõ, mmom ɛmɔ ne akrongronfoɛ bɔ baha ne te maen mmaa, na ɛmɔte Nyameɛ awurofoɛ, <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />ná bato ɛmɔ basie asomafoɛ ne adiifoɛ fapem naso, na Kristo Yesu bɔbɔ yeɛ ɔte fapem né nyɔboɛ titire ne. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Ye nu yeɛ sua namukoraati atoɔtoa nu pɛpɛɛpɛ, ná onyi yɛ asɔre awuro krongron ma Awurade. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Bamaa ɛmɔ ne Kristo ayɛ kõ, na bɛsi ɛmɔ bɛbɔnu maa ɔyɛ nekaa bɔ Nyameɛ nate ye honhom naso kɔtena ɔ.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Me Paul, Yesu Kristo ne ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔte maen-maen nanufoɛ nati, nna prizin. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Na medɛ́ medi kyɛ, ɛmɔ ate kyɛ Nyameɛ afa awura me sa kyɛ mmoka ɛmɔ ma ɛmɔnya ye adom naso mvasoɛ, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />na kyɛbɔ Nyameɛ yele edwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea ne hyirele me ne, ɛhene yeɛ nni moa ndworɔle ye nwo dwirɛ kaa ne. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Na sɛ ɛmɔkenga ɛhe a, ɛmɔkonwu kyɛbɔ mete Kristo nwo dwirɛ bɔ wafea nabo ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Mmerɛ bie bɔ wapɛ nu ne, wamma mmenia anwu sɔ dwirɛ bɔ wafea ne, kyɛbɔ kesaalae ɔnate honhom naso ala ye ali ahyire asomafoɛ ne adiifoɛ krongron ne. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Sɔ dwirɛ bɔ wafea ne yeɛ ole kyɛ, nzɛmba ne kɔmaa maen-maen ne né Kristo Yesu kɔyɛ kõ, na bɛ koso bɛkɔɔyɛ nnehyeɛ, bɛkɔboka nipadua akwaa naso, ná bɛne ye abɔnu nu anya bɔhyɛ nanu kyɛfa.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Nyameɛ adom ti, maayɛ sɔ dwirɛ nanwo somvoɛ, kyɛbɔ ye tumi yɛ adwuma nati yeɛ wafa ɛhe wahyɛ me ne. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Ɔwɔ nu, me yeɛ nde kaa paa wɔ akrongronfoɛ nanu ɔ, nakoso me yeɛ Nyameɛ afa alo me kyɛ nga Kristo ahonya bɔ ɔbo sona ndeaseɛ so nanwo dwirɛ ngyire maen-maen ne; <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />ná mma ebiala nwu kyɛbɔ Nyameɛ da edwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea ne ali ɔ, sɔ dwirɛ ne, ofi teteete yeɛ Nyameɛ bɔ ɔbɔle wiase ne afa afea ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Yeti ɔnate asafo naso kɔmaa awaen ne tumi ahoroɛ bɔ bɛwɔ anwuro dɔ ne konwu Nyameɛ nyanza bɔ ɔda ye nwo ali atee pee so ne. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Na ɛhe ne bɔ wabɔ ye tianu kyɛ ɔnate y'Awurade Yesu Kristo so kɔyɛ ye daa ne yia. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Yeti, yɛkora yɛdwudwo bɔ yɛnzuro, na gyidie bɔ yanya ye wɔ ye nu nati, yɛkora yɛfa akukuduro yɛkɔ Nyameɛ nyunu. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Yeti mesrɛ ɛmɔ, nnɛmɔ maa ɛmɔ abanu bu wɔ amaneɛ bɔ ɛmɔ ti menwu ye nanwo, ofikyɛ ɔte anuonyam ma ɛmɔ.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Ɛhe ati, mebu ndwerɛ wɔ Baba ne nyunu, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />ye berɛ yeɛ abusua biala bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne aseɛ so ne nya ye dumaa ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Bɔ mesrɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ye anuonyam bɔ ɔsone nati, ɔfa ye honhom ne ma ɛmɔnya anwoserɛ wɔ ɛmɔ nu, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />na ɛmɔ gyidie ti, Kristo atena ɛmɔ ahone nu. Ná ɛmɔ atira ndii batindim wɔ fapem naso wɔ ɔdɔ nu, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />na wamaa ɛmɔ ne akrongronfoɛ namukoraati ahora ate ye piri, ye tɛtrɛtɛ, ye tendee, ɔne kyɛbɔ enu kɔ nabo yé, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />ná ɛmɔ anwu Kristo dɔ bɔ ɔtra nimdeɛ ne, ná wamaa Nyameɛ suban namukoraati ayi ɛmɔ dɛen.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Afei ye bɔ ɔkora yɛ nikye maa ɔtra bɔ yɛsrɛ anaa yɛdwene ye nwo koraa, kyɛbɔ ye tumi bɔ ɔyɛ adwuma wɔ yɛ nu ne te ne, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />ye yeɛ anuonyam ha ye wɔ asafo nanu ne Kristo Yesu nu, wɔ aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ mukoraati nu daa daa. Amen.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Yeti, me bɔ Awurade ti nna prizin ne, mesrɛ ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔbɔ ɛmɔ bra ma ɔfata ɛfrɛlɛ bɔ bafrɛ ɛmɔ ne. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Ɛmɔdwo, na ɛmɔfa anwobraseɛ mukoraati ne aboterɛ bɛbɔ ɛmɔ bra, ná ɛmɔ ne ɛmɔ nwo tena wɔ ɔdɔ nu. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Ɛmɔyɛ bɔ ɛmɔkɔhora biala bɛbɔ ngabɔnu bɔ honhom ne amaa wawa ɛmɔ nu nanwo waen, na ɛmɔtena asomdwie bɔ waha ɛmɔ wabɔ nu nanu. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Nipadua komapɛ ne honhom komapɛ yeɛ ɔwɔ berɛ ɔ, kyɛbɔ bafrɛ ɛmɔ bawa anidasoɛ komapɛ nu ne, <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Awurade kõ, gyidie kõ, asubɔ kõ, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Nyameɛ komapɛ bɔ ɔte yɛ mukoraati Baba ne, ye yeɛ odi ebiala so, ɔkora fa ebiala yɛ adwuma, na ɔwɔ ebiala nu ne. <verse eid="EPH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Nyameɛ adom bɔ bafa bama yɛ nu biala ne, Kristo yeɛ wasusu akyɛdeɛ ne wafa wama yɛ ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Ná tworɔnzɛm ne ka kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">“Mmerɛ bɔ ɔfo hɔle anwuro ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">ɔfale ngoaa hɔle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">na ɔfale mmenia mane kyɛ akyɛdeɛ.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Sɛ ɔka kyɛ “ɔfo hɔle” a, okyire sɛɛ? Bɔ okyire yeɛ ole kyɛ oli moa dwu wale ase, kyire kyɛ ɔwale aseɛ he aso. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Na bɔ odwu wale ne, ye ala yeɛ ɔfo hɔle nekaa bɔ ɔtra anwuro mukoraati ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɔkɔmaa nikye biala koli mu ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Ná wamaa ebiemɔ ayɛ asomafoɛ, ebiemɔ ayɛ adiifoɛ, ebiemɔ ka nzɛmba, ebiemɔ nea asafo ne, ná ebiemɔ kyirekyire, <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɔkɔtete akrongronfoɛ nemɔ kɔma ɔsom adwuma ne, na wamaa Kristo nipadua ne ayɛ se, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />kodwu kyɛ yɛ mukoraati yɛkɔyɛ kõ wɔ gyidie nanu, yanya Nyameɛ Awa nanwo nimdeɛ bɔ odi mu, ná yayɛ mmenia bɔ yanyi yayie na yali mu te kyɛ Kristo pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Yeti, nnɛmɔ maa yɛkɔ so yɛyɛ kyɛ ngwalaa bɔ ngyerɛkyerɛ mvrama biala woso bɛ biri-biri fa bɛ di akɔ-ne-aba te kyɛ ɛpo asorɔkye, na bɛmaa mmenia fa nnaka-naka ne edwirɛ bɔ ɔtte nahorɛ laka-laka bɛ ne. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Mmom ɛmɔma yɛha nahorɛ, na yefi ɔdɔ nu yɛnyi wɔ nikye biala nu yɛhɔ Kristo bɔ ɔte nipadua ne ti nanu. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Ye nu yeɛ nipadua namukoraati aha abɔnu, ofikyɛ akwaa namukoraati aha asiesie so pɛpɛɛpɛ, na akwaa biala yɛ adwuma ye. Ɔba sɔ a, nipadua ne nyi, na ɔyɛ se wɔ ɔdɔ nu.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Yeti, bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ na medi ye nwo adanzeɛ wɔ Awurade nu ɛhe, nnɛmɔbɔ ɛmɔ bra kyɛbɔ maen-maen ne yɛ ye wɔ b'adwene bɔ ɔnze hwee nanu ne. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Bɛ de, awosii akata b'adwene naso, na bahwe bɛ nwo bafi ngoa bɔ Nyameɛ fa ma nanwo, ofikyɛ bɛlle nimdeɛ, ná bɛ so yɛ se. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Ná ɔnate kyɛ bɛmvɛle hwee nati, ahohwibra ali bɛ ti, na bɛbɔ bra-bɔne biala bɔ hwee nzi bɛ atee ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Nakoso ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔanwu ye kyɛ nná sɔ yeɛ Kristo te ɔ, <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />amba, ɛmɔtele ye nwo dwirɛ, na bɛnate ye so bɛhyirehyirele ɛmɔ, kyɛbɔ nahorɛ bɔ ɔwɔ Yesu nu ne te ne. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Ohyirehyirele ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔye suban daa ne bɛgua; ɛmɔ daa abrabɔ bɔ nnaka-naka akɔnnɔ ma ɔsɛkye ne, <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />na ɛmɔma bɛhɔ so bɛyɛ ɛmɔ adwene<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Adwene honhom.”</char></note> ne foforɛ, <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />na ɛmɔwura suban foforɛ bɔ Nyameɛ bɔle ye kyɛbɔ okuro ne, sɔ suban ne gyi tenenee ne nahorɛlilɛ so.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Yeti, kesaalae bɔ ɛmɔ aye ngondombo bagua nekaa bie ne, ɛmɔ nu biala ha nahorɛ hyire ye mmango, ofikyɛ yɛ mukoraati yɛte akwaa wɔ nipadua kõ anu. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />“Ɛmɔfɛ yaa, nakoso nnɛmɔyɛ bɔne.” Nnɛmɔfɛ yaa tonn kodwu kyɛ eyia kɔtɔ, <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />na nnɛmɔma Abɔnzam atee. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Nnɛmaa awieniɛ wia kõ, mmom ɔyɛ adwuma, ɔfa ye sa yɛ adwuma pa, ná wanya bie wama ebie bɔ wahia ye ne. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Nnɛmɔ maa edwirɛ bɔ waporɔ fite fi ɛmɔ noanu, mmom ɛmɔha edwirɛ bɔ ɔte pa na ɔhyɛ nguraen, ɛhene yeɛ bɛ bɔ betie ne konya so mvasoɛ ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Afei, nnɛmɔ maa Nyameɛ honhom krongron ne wora bɔ.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nnɛmɔyɛ nikye bɔ ɔkɔmaa Nyameɛ honhom ne wora kɔbɔ ɔ.”</char></note> Ofikyɛ ye yeɛ bafa bahyɛ ɛmɔ nzorɛ bama kyẽa bɔ bɛkole ɛmɔ ngoa ne. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Ɛmɔgyi ɛhe amukoraati bɛgua: ɔtaen, ɛyaa ne ahone tɛɛ, ndeɛteamuɛ ne mmusue dwirɛ, ɔne nikye biala bɔ ɔttemaye. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Mmom ɛmɔ huro-huro ɛmɔ nwo dwirɛ, ɛmɔnwu ɛmɔ nwo anwunvoin, ná ɛmɔfa ɛmɔ mmango bɔne bɛhyɛ bɛ, kyɛbɔ Nyameɛ nate Kristo so fa ɛmɔ deɛ kyɛ ɛmɔ koraa ne.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Yeti, ɛmɔsuesua Nyameɛ kyɛ ye mmaa bɔ ɔdɔ bɛ, <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />na ɛmɔhɔ so bɛnate ɔdɔ nu kyɛbɔ ne Kristo dɔ yɛ, ná ɔfale ye ngoa tole berɛ mane yɛ kyɛ akyɛdeɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ayɛyɛdeɛ.”</char></note> ne afɔleɛ fona-fona mane Nyameɛ ne.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Ná adwaman, bra-bɔne, ne anyeborolɛ po de, nnɛmɔ maa bɛbɔso po wɔ ɛmɔ nu, ofikyɛ ɔmvata mmenia bɔ bɛte krongron. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Afei koso, nnɛmɔ maa nikye bɔ ɔyɛ fɛle, ngwasea-keka, anaa aseresɛm bɔ ɔmvata fite ɛmɔ nu, mmom ɛmɔla ase. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Ofikyɛ ɛmɔse ye paa kyɛ, ebie bɔ ɔbɔ adwaman, ebie bɔ ɔbɔ bra-bɔne, anaa ebie bɔ ye nye boro nikye<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Okuro adufudeɛ.”</char></note> (kyire kyɛ, ebie bɔ ɔsõ bosoen) biala nne berɛ bɔ okonya ye nwo atee kɔhɔ Kristo ne Nyameɛ Ahennie nanu ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Nnɛmɔ maa ebiala fa edwirɛ mbaen biala laka-laka ɛmɔ, ofikyɛ sɔ nningyein hemɔ ati yeɛ Nyameɛ yaa ba asoserɛfoɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ngwalaa bɔ bɛ so yɛ se.”</char></note> so ne. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Yeti, nnɛmɔyɛ bɔ bɛyɛ ne bie. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Daa ne, ne ɛmɔte awosii, nakoso kesaalae de, ɛmɔte kanea wɔ Awurade nu, <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />na mmaa bɔ kanea ne su yeɛ ole bra pa, tenenee, ne nahorɛ biala. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Yeti ɛmɔnea, sɛ bɔ ɛmɔyɛ ne, ɔsɔ Awurade nye a. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Nningyein tɛɛ bɔ bɛyɛ ye wɔ awosii nu ne, nnɛmɔyɛ bie, mmom ɛmɔye bɛ bo bɛgua so. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Ofikyɛ nningyein bɔ bɛyɛ ye wɔ awosii nu ne, ɔyɛ fɛle po kyɛ bɛkɔbɔ so. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Na nikye biala bɔ ye nwo kɔla berɛ ne, kanea yeɛ ɔmaa ye nwo da berɛ ɔ, na nikye biala bɔ ye nwo ala berɛ ne, ɔte kanea. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Ɛhe ati, ɔka kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Wɔ bɔ ala ne, dwɔso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">dwɔso fi ewue nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">Na Kristo kɔmaa ɛkɔta.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Na ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo ye paa, ná kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ bra ne anyɛ kyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛnze nworɛ ne, mmom ɛmɔyɛ anyanzafoɛ, <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />ná ɛmɔfa ɛmɔ mmerɛ bɛyɛ nikye pa, ofikyɛ ngyẽa bɔ yɛwɔ nu ne, ɔttemaye. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Yeti, nnɛmɔyɛ kyɛ mmenia bɔ bɛlle adwene, mmom ɛmɔyɛ mmenia bɔ bɛte bɔ Awurade kuro nabo. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Ɛhe ati, nnɛmɔ no nzãa bɛbo, ofikyɛ ɔmaa sona yɛ basabasa. Mmom ɛmɔma honhom né yi ɛmɔ tɛkyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Ɛmɔfa edwein, ayɛyie dwein, ɔne honhom nu dwein bɛdwudwo behyire ɛmɔ nwo. Na ɛmɔto edwein wɔ ɛmɔ ahone nu bɛye Awurade ayɛ, <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />na daa biala, ɛmɔla yɛ Baba ne yɛ Nyameɛ ne ase wɔ nikye biala nu, wɔ Yesu Kristo dumaa nu.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Ɔnate kyɛ ɛmɔsuro Kristo nati, ɛmɔbrɛ ɛmɔ nwo ase bɛma ɛmɔ nwo. <verse eid="EPH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Mmrasua,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Yeɛmɔ.”</char></note> ɛmɔbrɛ ɛmɔ nwo ase bɛma bɛ humɔ, te kyɛ bɔ ɛmɔyɛ bɛma Awurade ne, <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />ofikyɛ brienzua yeɛ ɔte ɔye ti, kyɛbɔ Kristo te asafo ne ti, ná ɔte nipadua ne agyenkwa ne. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Na kyɛbɔ asafo ne brɛ ye nwo ase ma Kristo ne, sɔ ala yeɛ odikyɛ brasua koso brɛ ye nwo ase ma ohu wɔ nikye biala nu ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Mmrienzua, ɛmɔhɔ so benya ɔdɔ bɛma bɛ yemɔ, kyɛbɔ né Kristo koso dɔ asafo ne, na ɔfale ye ngoa tole berɛ mane ye ne, <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />na wamaa wafa edwirɛ ne wayɛ nzue wanwunzi asafo nanwo, na wate ye nwo, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, asafo ne nwo kɔwa anuonyam kɔma ye, na wayɛ krongron bɔ ɔpombole, na efiɛ, anaa ngekayɛɛ biala nne ye nwo ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Sɔ ala koso yeɛ odikyɛ mmrienzua dɔ bɛ yemɔ kyɛ bɛ bɔbɔ bɛ nwonaen. Ebiala bɔ ɔdɔ ɔye ne, ɔdɔ ye nwo. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Ná ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔtane ye bɔbɔ ye nwonaen ɔ, mmom ɔnea so ye,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔma ye aleɛ.”</char></note> na ɔmaa ye nye kɔ ye nwo, kyɛbɔ Kristo yɛ asafo ne, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />ofikyɛ yɛboka ye nipadua naso. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />“Ɛhe ati yeɛ brienzua kɔyakyi ye baba ne ye maame berɛ, na ɔne ɔye aha abɔnu, maa bɛ munyɔ ne ayɛ anwoɔnaen kõ.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Sɔ dwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea he te piri, ɛhe de, Kristo ne asafo nanwo dwirɛ yeɛ meka ne. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Nakoso, odikyɛ ɛmɔ nu biala dɔ ɔye kyɛ ye bɔbɔ ye nwo, ná brasua ne de, óbu ohu paa.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Ngwalaa, ɛmɔtie ɛmɔ awofo dwirɛ wɔ Awurade nu, ofikyɛ ɛhe yeɛ ɔte pa ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />“Fa nidie ma wɔ maame ne wɔ baba,” na ɛhe yeɛ ole mmeraa bɔ oli moa bɔ bɔhyɛ boka so, <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />“ná wasi wɔ yé wɔ aseɛ naso, maa anyi ahyɛ.” <verse eid="EPH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Baba mɔ, nnɛmɔyɛ nikye bɔ ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ mmaa nemɔ kɔfɛ yaa, mmom ɛmɔhɔ so bɛfa Awurade ndeɛsoɛ ne ngyerɛkyerɛ bɛtete bɛ.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Ngoaa, ɛmɔfi ɛmɔ ahone nu bɛfa esuronyi ne nidie bɛma ɛmɔ wuramɔ bɔ bɛte mmenia ne, te kyɛ bɔ ɛmɔyɛ bɛma Kristo ne. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Nnɛmɔyɛ ɛhe, mmerɛ bɔ mmenia nwu ɛmɔ ne ngome, ná wanyɛ kyɛ ɛmɔsɔ sona nye, mmom ɛmɔyɛ ye kyɛ Kristo ngoaa bɔ bɛfi bɛ kra mukoraati nu bɛyɛ bɔ Nyameɛ kuro ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Mmom, ɛmɔfa suban pa bɛsõ bɛ, te kyɛ bɔ ɛmɔyɛ bɛma Awurade ne, nná sona, <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />ofikyɛ ɛmɔse kyɛ, pa bɔ ɛmɔ nu biala kɔyɛ ne, sɛ ɔte akoaa oo, ɔte dehyeɛ oo, okonya ye nwo akatua kofi Awurade berɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔte bɛ wura ne koso, ɛmɔyɛ bɛ sɔ ala, nnɛmɔ nwuna-nwuna bɛ, ofikyɛ ɛmɔse kyɛ, ɛmɔ ne bɛ mukoraati, ɛmɔ wura wɔ anwuro, na ye de, ɔnnea sona nyunu.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Afei, ɛmɔyɛ se wɔ Awurade ne ye tumi bɔ ɔyɛ se nanu. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Ɛmɔfa Nyameɛ akodeɛ namukoraati bɛwura, na wamaa ɛmɔ ahora bagyina pindinn baho batia Abɔnzam nnaka-naka ne, <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />ofikyɛ, nná mogya ne anwoɔnaen yeɛ yɛne bɛ kõ ɔ, mmom yɛne awaen ahoroɛ, tumidie, ewiase awosii nu atumvoɛ, ɔne sunzummɔne bɛ bɛwɔ anwuro dɔ ne yeɛ yɛkõ ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Ɛhe ati, ɛmɔwura akodeɛ bɔ ofi Nyameɛ berɛ namukoraati, ná ɛmɔ ahora bagyina kyẽa tɛɛ bɔ ɔba ne noa baho, na sɛ ɛmɔyie nikye biala a, ɛmɔ agyina pindinn.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Yeti, ɛmɔgyina berɛ pindinn, na ɛmɔfa nahorɛ ne bɛyɛ bɛlɛt<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Abɔsoɛ.”</char></note> bɛbɔ ɛmɔ sisia, ɛmɔfa tenenee bɛkata ɛmɔ hue so, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />na ɛmɔwura mmaboa bɔ okyire kyɛ ɛmɔ ayɛ krado kyɛ ɛmɔkɔha asomdwie nzɛmba ne. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Ɛhe mukoraati si ne, ɛmɔfa gyidie kyɛm ne bɛtira, ná ɛhene yeɛ ɛmɔkɔfa bɛkonua ɔbɔnefoɛ ne agyan bɔ ɔsɔ namukoraati. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Afei, ɛmɔfa ngoa buralɛ-kyerɛ ne, ɔne honhom nu dadeɛ ne, ɛhene yeɛ ole Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Ɛmɔfa mbaeɛ ne ngotosrɛ biala so bɛbɔ mbaeɛ daa wɔ honhom né tumi nu. Yeti, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ, na ɛmɔsrɛ bɛma akrongronfoɛ nemɔ. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Me koso, ɛmɔ bɔ mbaeɛ bɛma me, na mmerɛ biala bɔ ngɔbukye me noa ne, bama me dwirɛ bɔ nga ɔ, na mahora mafa akukuduro maha nzɛmba nanwo dwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea né mahyire mmenia. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Sɔ nzɛmba ne bɔ ngyi ye gya nu nati yeɛ bafa kyenyi bakyekye me bato prizin ne. Yeti ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ bɛma me, ná wamaa mahora mafa akukuduro maha, kyɛbɔ odikyɛ meyɛ ne.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Bɔ ɔkɔyɛ na ɛmɔ koso ɛmɔ anwu kyɛbɔ me nwo te, ɔne bɔ ɔkɔ so wɔ ɛwa ne, nniema Tikiko bɔ medɔ ye, na odi nahorɛ wɔ Awurade nu ne, ɔkɔfa ye mukoraati nwo amaneɛ kɔɔbɔ ɛmɔ. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ mesoma ye meba ɛmɔ berɛ ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛmɔ konwu kyɛbɔ yɛ nwo te ɔ, na wasa wahyɛ ɛmɔ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɛmɔ ahone.”</char></note> nguraen.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Asomdwie ha aliemaa mɔ, na ɛmɔnya ɔdɔ ne gyidie bɛfi Nyameɛ bɔ ɔte Baba ne, ɔne y'Awurade Yesu Kristo berɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Bɛ bɔ bɛfi b'ahone nu bɛkuro y'Awurade Yesu Kristo dwirɛ namukoraati ne, adom ha bɛ.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>